    "body": "Hi, @janewman \n\nI had worked on the Spatial Navigation (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-nav-1/), which defines a general model for navigating the focus using the arrow keys, as well as related CSS, JavaScript features and Events.\n\nI also deep dived into the aria concerns and how to move focus in the scrollable area.\nDo you think there is any cross-passing between the Spatial Navigation and the `focusgroup` attributes?\n",
