    "body": "> Not sure if this is the right place to post a new feature request for `focusgroup`. Please redirect me if not.\n\n@freshp86 I filed https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/1490, I'm a little on the fence if focusgroup is the right mechanism to be managing the state here, but I know this is a super common problem that developers find themselves in when making removable content, so I think this is important to discuss. please feel free to add any additional thoughts, context, etc into the new issue on Open UI.",
